Author: Tomás Herrera <tomas@acme.example>
Date:   Mon Jun 15 09:41:22 2026 +0100

    Add PATCH /shipments/:id for customer corrections

    Support has been raising tickets to fix typo'd references and wrong
    destination postcodes on booked shipments, which currently means a
    cancel-and-rebook and a new tracking number for the customer.

    Adds a partial-update endpoint behind shipments:write. The patch body is
    validated with validateShipmentPatch, which only admits the fields a
    correction is allowed to touch.

    Closes SHIP-2214.

